2:T606,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is studying 12 hours a day good for exams?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It can work for short sprints of 2-4 weeks before a major exam, but 6-8 hours of genuinely focused study sustained for months outperforms 12 hours of exhausted, distracted reading. If you attempt 12 hours, structure it as six 90-minute blocks with real breaks and protected sleep."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How many hours of sleep do I need if I study 12 hours?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Still 7-8 hours. Sleep is when the brain consolidates what you studied into long-term memory - cutting sleep to study more is trading retention for time. Toppers consistently sleep 7+ hours during preparation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I actually stop getting distracted during long study sessions?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Keep your phone in another room during 90-minute blocks, use timed sessions so breaks are guaranteed, and study the hardest subject in your sharpest window. If distraction is chronic, shrink to 6 focused hours and rebuild."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the warning signs of study burnout?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Falling recall despite long hours, dread before opening books, sleep problems, irritability, and reading the same line repeatedly. The fix is counterintuitive: take 2-3 days of genuine rest, sleep fully, then restart at 60 percent load and rebuild."}}]}3:T579,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"HowTo","name":"How to Study 12+ Hours a Day Without Burnout (2026 Guide)","description":"A realistic 12-hour study timetable built on 90-minute focus blocks, real breaks, and sleep science - plus the burnout warning signs and the recovery protocol if you have already hit the wall.","step":[{"@type":"HowToStep","position":1,"name":"Start from 6 hours, not 12","text":"Build a 6-hour schedule you can actually complete for a full week, then add one block every 5-7 days. Capacity is trained, not declared."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":2,"name":"Split the day into 90-minute blocks","text":"The brain sustains deep focus for roughly 90 minutes before performance drops. Twelve hours means six real blocks, not one endless marathon."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":3,"name":"Protect sleep before study hours","text":"Fix 7-8 hours of sleep first. Cutting sleep to buy study hours costs more retention than it buys time."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":4,"name":"Schedule breaks like a subject","text":"Meals, a walk, and a hard stop at night go into the timetable as non-negotiable rows. A break that is not scheduled gets stolen by your phone."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":5,"name":"Track completion, not hours","text":"Log what actually got done each day and let the next day adjust around it - manually, or automatically with an AI planner."}]}b:["slug","how-to-study-12-hours-without-burnout","d"]
d:T668,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","@id":"https://planbotai.app/#organization","name":"PlannextTech","alternateName":"PlanBot Team","url":"https://planbotai.app","areaServed":{"@type":"Country","name":"Worldwide"},"logo":"https://planbotai.app/android-chrome-512x512.png","description":"PlannextTech builds advanced AI productivity tools and scheduling systems for ambitious individuals. PlanBot is our flagship AI daily planner app for Android, designed to optimize time management and routine generation.","founder":{"@type":"Person","name":"Naitik Baldaniya","jobTitle":"Founder & CEO","url":"https://planbotai.app/about","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/naitik-baldaniya-b0079234a","https://www.instagram.com/planbotai?igsh=bXplYm92dG13c3Jq","https://x.com/planbotai"],"description":"Productivity systems architect and software developer specializing in AI-driven scheduling algorithms and Spaced Repetition Systems.","knowsAbout":["AI Planning","Time Management","Student Productivity","Study Planning","JEE Preparation","NEET Preparation","UPSC Preparation","Task Automation","Goal Setting","Focus Systems","Habit Formation"],"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"PlannextTech","url":"https://planbotai.app"}},"sameAs":["https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Vb7U0vR8aKvH1quo1f3G","https://www.instagram.com/planbotai?igsh=bXplYm92dG13c3Jq","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=cpm.planbot","https://x.com/planbotai","https://youtube.com/@planbotai"],"contactPoint":{"@type":"ContactPoint","email":"plannexttech@gmail.com","contactType":"customer support","availableLanguage":["English","Hindi"]}}0:["Y3sVrwzzMRbFC8kMCynJl",[[["",{"children":["blog",{"children":[["slug","how-to-study-12-hours-without-burnout","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"how-to-study-12-hours-without-burnout\"}",{}]}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["blog",{"children":[["slug","how-to-study-12-hours-without-burnout","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{}